{"games":[{"id":7009799230,"name":"Pressure Wash Simulator","desc":"Welcome to Roblox Pressure Washing Simulator, the most satisfying simulator game on Roblox! In this power washing tycoon and simulator, you can roleplay as a power washer with your friends, from cleaning vans to cars, houses, gardens and more! \r\n\r\nUpgrade your power wash guns for better pressure to wash more efficiently especially with larger nozzles! More pressure takes more water from the tank, so make sure to upgrade your tanks too!\r\n\r\n📝UPDATE LOG:\r\n- 10 New Cleanable Areas in a new world!\r\n\r\n👍LIKE THE GAME FOR NEW UPDATES!👍\r\n\r\nFollow the game to know when there's a new update so you don't miss out!\r\n\r\nMade with ❤️ by\r\nSub & Fluff\r\n\r\nSpecial thanks to FallenAngel, Jaka, BlueGrass and Starmaq! Inspired by Power Wash Simulator on Steam! \r\nPost bugs & suggestions in the group below!","path":"/game/7009799230-pressure-wash-simulator","slug":"7009799230-pressure-wash-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b36706b3d08ea016e3101d2fd15d775ccf1ed607d946f1b2b4aa01142fd141aa.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-364612a445c3c9071b2455803d16991e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":141106432,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-06T17:57:01.085Z","creator":{"name":"Small World Games - Tycoons!","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":11,"freeCount":11,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":6242640409,"name":"Area 51: Zombie Infection","desc":"💥 Welcome to Area 51 Soldier 💥\nYour goal is to save the president and the country, we are counting on you and the team! Don't go dying on us, become the strongest army there is and defeat all the zombies!\n\n🌟 LIKE the game and JOIN this group to receive a FREE GOLD sniper!\nhttps://www.roblox.com/My/Groups.aspx?gid=5790554\n\n⭐ THIS MAY: DOUBLE XP & CREDITS + 25% OFF ON GAMEPASSES! ⭐\n\n🌟 62,000 Likes: We'll release a new code & 25% off on Gamepasses for 1 week\n🌟 USE CODE SIXTY for $15,000 Credits!\n\nUPDATES:\n- Nothing!\n\nUPCOMING UPDATES:\n- New Melees\n- Purchasable Suits w/ credits\n- More missions (earn credits)\n- More levels\n- Harder zombies (for higher level players)\n\n😎 Premium Benefits: 👍\n- 200 Health!\n- 25 Walkspeed!\n- 40 Jump Power!\n- Exclusive Suits & Rare Accessories!","path":"/game/6242640409-area-51-zombie-infection","slug":"6242640409-area-51-zombie-infection","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/05b185f979aa07c784ae54fa26544bd2b10d164171d16008a8ea672c455444b9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-31ee8171e5d59f5ff5148bad2fa51646/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":16552029,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-01-22T11:34:19.614Z","creator":{"name":"Played It","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7331953588,"name":"[🎉UPDATE] Tower Defense: Mythic [ALPHA]","desc":"Welcome to Tower Defense : Mythic!\n\n👍New code at 15k likes! Use code \"10KLIKES\" for free coins 💰 and \"WINTER22\" for free gems! 💎\n\nHow to play:\n🔨 Build awesome defensive towers\n⭐ Click on and upgrade your towers\n🧠 Use strategies to beat up to 350 different stages\n🌟 Rebirth to earn overpowered mythic items\n👑 Climb the leaderboards to rank #1\n\n🐛 Report bugs in our community server. Thanks!\n\n🐌 Experiencing lag? Turn off bullets in settings or lowering your graphics quality.\n\nUpdate:\n- 🗺️ Winter map\n- ❄️ Winter skin crate\n- 💎 Gingerbread Blaster (gem tower)\n- 🎄 Festive turret (rebirth tower)\n- 🎅 Holiday turret (robux tower)\n- 🥶  Ice Dragon (rebirth tower)\n- 🎄 Festive minigun (limited tower)\n- 🍬  Candy Cane Cannon (limited tower)\n- 📜  3 event quests\n- ⛄  Snowball trait\n\n--- Credits --- \nHead Developer: MuPower\n3D Modeler: UfoHunter10","path":"/game/7331953588-tower-defense-mythic","slug":"7331953588-tower-defense-mythic","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/66cf90fb88bf2acca203b2b6fa64f5c51aa5e5e717f92ff10181f7ba40c1e644.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-61